      "type": "paragraph",
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Same rule, new set. Before looking at the diagrams below, predict: name the inversion, name which voice the rule points at, drop it a fret, then check. Nothing about strings 2-3-4 should change the answer — the rule reads the inversion, not the strings it happens to be sitting on. Neck order here starts with first inversion, down at the nut, then climbs through second inversion to root position."
        }
      ]
